{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"bodyItems-wrapper\">    科技｜黃仁勳離任動搖客戶信心　AMD與Google乘勢搶攻AI晶片市場           <p class=\"text text-block paragraph text-left tight-spacing neo-font-paragraph-xl-reg yf-18d6y07\" style=\"text-decoration: none; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; text-align: inherit; font-variant-numeric: normal;\">英偉達（Nvidia）前行政總裁黃仁勳因多宗婚外情醜聞辭職，董事會委任財務總監Colette Kress出任臨時行政總裁。有報道指，人事變動令部分客戶對英偉達的信心減弱，AMD及Google藉機擴大人工智能晶片市場份額。有雲端服務商認為，財務總監在資本配置上較審慎，難以解決算力短缺，故把AMD晶片由測試轉為實際部署。不過，英偉達憑藉龐大產量在台積電享有優先產能，交貨期明顯短於AMD，仍具吸引力。  </p> </div> </body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T08:44:50.718302+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":235,"images":0,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T08:00:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T08:38:12.969148+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T08:38:12.969148+00:00","content_hash":"609a9602e68980bbe00db44b696eda3c274325d70ebc96f9dd7e1982ccb9d582","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}